Z||000006||Thomas||11-08-1999||10:55 AM||||Two jears ago i fixed a problem like this at a fiero from a friend.<BR>The cable was rusted inside. So some lines of the cable are broken. The resistens of the cable was to high for proper work.<BR>A part of the cable, beginning from the sensor, along 10 inches was bat.||||reg||10
